# Scrapyard Haven's battery dump (CIPlay scrapyard_haven_acid, 11-12 w15 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the
# recipe: the pool shacidpool and the acid zone sh_acid at 16 -55 (r 2.5, safe=suit), the spares box at 17.8 -56 inside it;
# the suit box shsuits at 10.5 -52 and the sign shacidsign at 10 -55.5. Into the acid without a suit: hurt; out again.
# Offline-written, never run; re-read the offset after the build (a new hill may move the land centre).
island Scrapyard Haven keep
hour 11
weather Calm

empty
expect shown shacid
walk 6 -52 to 9 -54 to 11 -55
read BATTERY DUMP
picture sh_acid 9 +2.5 -55 16 +0 -55
walk 11 -55 to 13.5 -55 to 16 -55
wait 5
expect message Battery acid
expect hurt 10
walk 16 -55 to 13 -55 to 10 -55
wait 3
expect unhurt
